# Normalize line endings so a file edited on Windows does not show up as a
# whole-file rewrite in the next diff. Without this, README.md was stored with
# CRLF while AGENTS.md used LF, and a one-line change reported 389 lines
# changed — which hides the real edit and makes review pointless.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows-only scripts must keep CRLF; cmd.exe mis-parses LF-only .bat files.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Binary assets: never touch these, and never try to diff them as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.pt binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
